<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE - Fyffes H1 pre-tax profit down 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fyffes H1 pre-tax profit down 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence), adjusted  3.38		   vs 3.21</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.5716		 vs 0.5196</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    20.22		  vs 20.76</p>
